Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜单上有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能是咸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be ceviche.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭臭的 那是彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stinky-oo, it's Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, Timon…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这首歌真是让我感动极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that song always gets me right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快转到我们出现的地方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fast forwarding to the part where we come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't go out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 我的猪朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au contraire, my porcine pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥控器在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这样大家会搞混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everyone's going to get confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得从故事一开始看起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go back to the beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事一开始没有我们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not in the beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我们一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we were… the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我们一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we were… the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可是观众不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那何不告诉大家我们的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't we tell them our story?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我有个点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, l've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉大家我们的故事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we tell them our story?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那个点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是带着观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little backstage tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后台参观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them behind the scenes for a revealing and intimate look…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在幕后观赏戏中戏一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the story within the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为观众不知道 我们怎么会 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what they don't know is how we really were there…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们一直都在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though they didn't know we were there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't have said it better myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们要从头看起了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does this mean we're going back to the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 彭彭 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Pumbaa, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要从故事开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going way back…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,的更早之前说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}to before the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:02:05.11,Title,0,0,0,0,,《狮子王3：丁满彭彭历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pride Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此雄伟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maestic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真威武\N{\fnArial\fs30}So powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真… 奇怪的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So bizarrely named.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,岩石怎么会荣耀 只是块石头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, how can a rock be proud? It's a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是因为狮子是万兽之王吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's because a pride is what they call a group of lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 狮子得到荣耀石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure, the lions get Pride ock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们这些狐獴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about us meerkats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所生长的地方 没啥值得一提的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I come from, we didn't have nothing to be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那啥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我还是只小狐獴\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a young meerkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他还是只小狐獴\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he was a young meerkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许带他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe it would be safer…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的故乡比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I just show them where I came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 我们能看看你成长的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy! Do we get to see where you grew up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 只是不太雅观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Pumbaa, but it ain't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐下 还没有拍完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please remain seated while the camera is in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从荣耀石到这个令人羞愧的窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Pride rock to the pity of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在食物链的很下层 我们生活在地底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're so slow on the food chain, we're underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't have to take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但听听我的狐獴同胞们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ust let my fellow meerkats do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that, what was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里 什么 在哪里 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, what, where, where, What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀 土狼要来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, before the hyena come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你完成 就有一个大地道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're done, you dig a bigger tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 在土狼来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, before the hyena come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 在土狼来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, before the hyena come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig, digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不停地挖呀 永远也挖不完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could dig and never get done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 在土狼来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick before the hyena come, dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖地道是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah is what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命就像是地道 等待我们挖掘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's a tunnah we're diggin' through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖地道为我们所歌颂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah is what we sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖地道就是我们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥和土是狐獴的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mud and clay is a meerkat's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,布满于每个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always more around every bend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,无止无尽的泥和土\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you get to your tunnah's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利路亚 继续挖呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallelujah, let's dig again, dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你完成 就有一个大地道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's done, you dig a bigger tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 在土狼来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, before the hyena come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有看到我儿子？他有没有经过这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my son? Has he been through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖地道啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯叔叔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 你看到丁满没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Max, relax. Have you seen Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到 今天还真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I haven't, and what a day it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有骨折 没有擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fractures, no lacerations…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有脑震荡 没有挫伤 或任何形式种类的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}no concussions, contusions, or injuries of any sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有任何丁满工作过的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no sign of Timon's handiwork anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好啊 闯祸大王 - 除了他 谁会开天窗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Way to go, tunnel klutz. - Who else could break a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期四次 又创记录了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four in one week… a new record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 这叫天窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's called a skylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有创意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Isn't that creative?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A skylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟他谈谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just have a word with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想为我们可悲的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to shed a little light…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,增添一点光彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our pathetic existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 不能再乱来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, this can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个月你已捅破了四面墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just this month, you've pulled down four walls…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞塌了两个出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and collapsed two tunnel exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该互相照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to look after each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样才能生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our survival depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么用呢 我们就知道挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point? All we do is dig…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖了后藏起来 藏起后再挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can hide, and hide so we can dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到不用挖洞的地方去生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be where we don't have to dig tunnels…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在地面上抬头挺胸生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and live with our heads stuck in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦想有个更好的家有什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so bad about dreaming of a better home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给你看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看远方的地平线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out to the horizon…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过那片树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}past the trees…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过那片草地\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the grasslands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光所照到的地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything the light touches…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}belongs to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你要说点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. I thought you were going a whole different direction with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说什么 是大自然的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? It's nature's design.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是其他动物的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. We're food for other animals…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一顿移动的美食\N{\fnArial\fs30}a moveable feast…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的动物都可以享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}feared by no one and eaten by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们死后会变成草\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when they die, they become the grass…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃草 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we eat the grass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我们吃草不消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly. We can't digest grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法忍受草\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're grass intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啦 麦斯 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Max. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了大忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,狐獴 是别人的晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meerkat… it's what's for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 麦斯叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想麦斯叔叔的头 一定多撞了一块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think uncle Max dislodged one too many rocks with his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他说的没错 丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's right, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我知道这里 一定有你可以胜任的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just know there's a way for you to fit in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 今天谁放哨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who's on sentry duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it… my son on sentry duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「哨兵丁满」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon the sentry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满当哨兵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon the sentry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用土狼来 现在就杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you save the hyenas the trouble and kill me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要监视那些土狼就行啦 看到他们来了你就喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is watch for hyenas and yell if you see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看小乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at Iron Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要闭上眼睛 不要到处乱看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't close your eyes! Don't look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要有人放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to guard us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要有人保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's gotta protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我被你说服啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now l'm convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it's outside…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在微风里 在外面的天空下\N{\fnArial\fs30}up in the breeze, under the wide open sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不正是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你还想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you would rather have him…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他继续挖洞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}go back on the digging crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 就这样决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, then we all agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 要听麦斯叔叔的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, listen to Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会教你一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll teach you everything you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 这次要好好干啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, honey, try to make this one work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到土狼来了 你该做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do we do if we see a hyena?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊「妈咪」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scream, "Mommy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, mister…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个世界到处都是危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the world out there is fraught with danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fraught, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 孩子 到处都有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy. It's the fraught fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…等着把我们撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rip us limb from limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 麦斯叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍成电影上映一定卖座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to sell it to the cheap seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管鼓掌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Applaud now, sonny boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到没手时看你怎么鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}but try clapping when you don't have any hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去 缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scurry, sniff, flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活不该只是惊慌失措\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to life than panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心成为他人的美食\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bein' some other guy's snack, yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许是很好吃的健康食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be delicious organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我这道小菜要反抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this little entree's fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不挖洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put digging tunnels behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开始新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And live at a new altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去摘星星 为的是提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna reach for the stars to remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,狐獴不是他人的食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}That meerkats are not merely food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once l'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lookin' out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'll tell you what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只狐獴要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cat is movin' on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他的生活 一点都不美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bon vivant who's missin' out on bon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要成为大亨 远离这片沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be a bigger cheese far from the desert scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一阵凉爽的清风 一片怡人的绿地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little cooling breeze, a little patch of green.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要得意自在地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And l'll be snoozing in my hammock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺在涓涓小溪边的吊床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}By a rippling stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离那些洞穴 远离那些挖洞的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many miles from any tunnel and the digging team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要过好日子 这就是我的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking after number one will be my only creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要过好日子 这就是我的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking after number one will be my only creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我总是逃来逃去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been good at running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要主宰一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I'm gonna run the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我总被人视为盘中飧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been seen as the ultimate prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的地位不同以往啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now my status ain't so quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个伟大的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dream sublime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那土狼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hyena time…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 一场晚餐秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, it's dinner and a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我以为 只有豆芽菜跟音乐搭得上边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought beans were the only musical food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你也好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hi to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 现在不是玩的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no time for horseplay, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该在上面监视…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be up there looking out for…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}hyenas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 他们四面奔逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, look at them scramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢看他们这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's just how I like them…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}scrambled…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还到处窜来窜去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a little bit runny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyenas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么啦 疯啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a meshugginah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来闻去？缩头藏尾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stumpy? Flinchy? Swifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算万幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯叔叔在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Uncle Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max! Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快装死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今秋麂皮最时髦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suede is the look for this fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 你坐在遥控器上啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, you're sitting on the remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 对不起 我以为是块饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Oh, sorry. I thought it was a brownie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯 你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got it, Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在该跑的时候 竟然缩头藏尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flinched when I should've scurried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是很有趣 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. lt just never gets old, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这游戏总是玩不腻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The classics never do, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该向大家道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I owe everyone an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我犯了个小小的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so I made a teensy mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在放哨的时候 肯定也唱过歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we all haven't broken into song on sentry duty before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱过的 举手我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let me have a show of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还需要段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a little too soon…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后谈到此事我们会开怀大笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but l'm sure we're all going to laugh about this someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, sweetie…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远也不适合这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going to fit in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody even likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都喜欢你 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure they do, honey. Sure they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 只有你喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides you, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我以外…还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides me? There's…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找属于我的地方 这里不适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to find my place, but it isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里适合你 我们只是还没有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is. We just haven't found it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意 你可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's an idea. You can…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再弄头发了 妈妈 适合我的地方在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop with the hair already. My place is out there, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那里有多远 可是我一定要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not know exactly where or how far, but I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 如果我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait. I know. lf we just…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 我希望你能找到 属于你的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope you find what you're looking for, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快憋死我啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}choking. Not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪大家会觉得我很古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people wonder why I have issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, l'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know you will. You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟陌生人讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to strangers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵后面别忘了洗干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, wash behind your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我不是小孩儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma, l'm not a kid anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要独自去游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never go swimming without a buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 情绪高昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, with high spirits…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勇敢地出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I boldly ventured off…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,到狐獴从不敢去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where no meerkat had dared to go before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把过去抛在脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my past behind me…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never looked back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该朝哪个方向走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你想到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends on what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所不知的猴子即时出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter omniscient monkey, right on cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道人们怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,学生准备好了 老师就会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the student is ready, the teacher appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了 你用不着幸运签饼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. No more fortune cookies for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,更好的问题是 你要到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the better question is, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个美好的地方 先生 那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace wonderful, mister, where…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个美好的地方 先生 那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace wonderful, mister, where…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到几分钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't happen to catch the song…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唱的那首歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sang a few minutes ago, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能欣赏到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have the pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一下 我要到外面 一个美丽的地方去生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}To recap, I want to live in some beautiful place outside…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个让我无忧无虑 不再躲藏和担忧的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}a carefree place where I don't have to hide or worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种无忧无虑的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life without worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要找 「哈库拉马塔塔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seek hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉他个头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harpoon a tomato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「无忧无虑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means "No worries."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.45,0:17:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好啦 用你的棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Mind taking that stick of yours…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我画个地图好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drawing me a map, bub?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想找到它 你必须超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find it, you must look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是你要超越自己的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个猴子 跟我讲起哲学来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a load of the monkey getting all existential on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这音乐让我没法子思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to think with all this music.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. It's coming to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为吃了鼻涕虫 就是我大彻大悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's either that slug I ate or l'm having an epiphany.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到那块大石头那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the big pointy rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只陌生猴子是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that strange monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦想之家 我来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream home, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪却很有智慧的猴子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange but wise monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 第一印象很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, first impressions are very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是个滑稽演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就吃了我吧 请你快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just eat me now… and please make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对疼痛的忍耐有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a low threshold for pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 小家伙 我不会吃你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy there, little guy. I'm not going to eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不吃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你跟踪我干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why were you stalking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.39,0:20:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你走过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, gee, I saw you go by…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 你这个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I figured a little fellow like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该独自出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}shouldn't be out here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢 你不也是独自一人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about you? You're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是独自一人 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are all alone, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 大多数动物 都离我远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Most animals give me a pretty wide berth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 连那些饿的也不吃你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do? Even the hungry ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我让他们离我远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I drive almost everyone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到我来了就躲了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People see me coming, and they run for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们唯恐闪躲不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't get out of the way fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't say, you don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是你发光的獠牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be the gleam on those vicious tusks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把恐惧刺入了他们的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strikes fear into their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 他们说 我倒他们的胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, they say I wreck their appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:21:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是你有这个… 特异功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. It's like you have this special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,特异功能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常特别的功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's pretty powerful, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我雇你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. You're hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 雇我干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我到那块大石头那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get me to a little worry-free haven…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,无忧无虑的地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}out by that big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我跟你一起去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身边又没有其他 可爱的大疣猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see any other big lovable chunk of warthog here…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还刚好长着一双獠牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}who also happens to have razor-sharp tusks…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,能驱赶那些野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the ability to repel predators?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 咱俩看法完全一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, I can tell… we see eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 像朋友一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别心急 大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, easy there, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说像是… 熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say more like… acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 总算是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,握个手吧 熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'er there, acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是丁满 - 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm Timon. - Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 跟我讲明一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, clear up one thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不吃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't going to eat me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算是哪种古怪的野猪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of a wacky, wild pig are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是食虫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an insectivore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃虫子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bug eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前不知道还有个专有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just never had a name for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.17,0:22:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢吃爬虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of partial to the crawly critters myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.77,0:22:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢 - 我有时喜欢吃带翅膀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about you, big boy? - l prefer the ones with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 这可能是个 熟人关系的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, this could be the start of a beautiful…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,美好开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}acquaintanceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在回到开头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so now we're back at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 丁满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对啦 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got that right, pally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气终于好起来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last, things were looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩上有阳光 脚旁有风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the sun on my shoulders, the wind at my heels…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,心中有首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A song in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个大胖家伙保护着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to protect me, a great big fat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得我很胖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I look fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, Pumbaa, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是头猪 这是表扬你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a pig. It's a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.27,0:23:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是生命之轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它环绕着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it moves us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.48,0:23:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是了… 那块大石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is… the big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里人真多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a land rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.29,0:23:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大嘴的猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That loudmouth monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他告诉了全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've blabbed it to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底说什么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的视线该超越这块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you're supposed to look beyond the big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该看看大石头的那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe l'm supposed to look beyond the big pointy rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's have a little look, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:23:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.42,0:24:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猴子眼光独到 可以去搞房地产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monkey's got an eagle eye for real estate!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.79,0:24:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那只猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! It's the monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.09,0:24:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他举的是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that he's holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.56,0:24:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它呢 不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, who cares? It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.63,0:24:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 我的梦中家园在等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! My dream home awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢很多人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do so well in crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.47,0:24:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绕着过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we better go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know the shortest distance…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.24,0:24:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的梦中家园最短的距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}between me and my dream home…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一条直线？跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a straight line? Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.68,0:24:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一让 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make room, make room!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.88,0:24:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 长角的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, twiggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.78,0:24:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm walkin' here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.06,0:25:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 我有话跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon! There's something I gotta tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, Pumbaa, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们安排妥当后 自然有足够时间聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have plenty of time to chat once we settle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.78,0:25:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的想休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could really use a rest stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 你有机会休息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. You'll get your second wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.58,0:25:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a really bad feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.46,0:25:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 犀牛在鞠躬呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, the rhinos are bowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好也鞠躬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better bow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.51,0:25:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 陛下 大家都向王子跪拜表达敬意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sire, how they kneel before the royal son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的特异功能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I guess that's your special power, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.89,0:25:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真猛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.63,0:26:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 你不在意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是放屁嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.67,0:26:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢炫耀自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't like to toot my own horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Pumbaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.24,0:26:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来带路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.29,0:26:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.39,0:26:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 温馨的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home, sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.39,0:26:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和任何人分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't gotta share it with anybody. Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.89,0:26:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不感到孤独吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get, you know, lonely out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.59,0:26:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤独？我会感到无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonely? Try commitment-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤来挤去的 让我感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elbow-to-elbow life reminds me…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到了以前的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little too much of home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.83,0:26:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place has everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.67,0:26:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,清爽的饮料 舒适的小吊床\N{\fnArial\fs30}cool refreshments, cozy little hammock…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.27,0:26:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的水流 这些全都属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lovely water feature, and it's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.41,0:26:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的梦想实现了 丁满…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's really coming together, Timon, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, I guess I'll just be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, now. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.46,0:27:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有规定说你一定要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no law that says you have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.30,0:27:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you want…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.50,0:27:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我已经铺好了两张床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! I already made up two beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张是你的 一张是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for you, and one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.35,0:27:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些整理工作把我累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, all this construction work has me bushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要早睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think l'll turn in early.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.31,0:27:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝今晚梦见臭虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream of bedbugs tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 温馨的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home, sweet home indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.05,0:28:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小声一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, keep it down up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有邻居吗 我们该去打个招呼才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have neighbors? We should go say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.02,0:28:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵闹的邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noisy neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.28,0:28:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下房子不值钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There go the property values.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上走的 天上飞的 大家都来听啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it in the herd and on the wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是国王辛巴的一件美事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be King Simba's finest fling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真等不及想当国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just can't wait to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我们到了戏剧街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. We moved to the theater district.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.97,0:28:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这帮家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a load of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不及想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.21,0:29:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.69,0:29:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.66,0:29:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,打起精神 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin up, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.93,0:29:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的梦中家园就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dream home's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到过一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Timon, I once came across a place…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能就是你要找的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might be just what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,壮观的瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spectacular waterfalls…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.10,0:29:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个沙漠绿洲里\N{\fnArial\fs30}set in a lush tropical oasis…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.67,0:29:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一排排…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a scrumptious array of…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.84,0:29:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,算啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Forget it, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.28,0:29:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是现实主义者 不喜欢追逐幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a realist, and l'm not gonna go chasing after some fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.85,0:29:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要超越我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你总是超越视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you always go beyond what you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.45,0:29:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道你到了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you know when you're there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.79,0:29:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, l'll tell you how I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.75,0:29:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.33,0:29:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a lovely spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.76,0:29:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乡村式的独特风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely, rustic, picturesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.73,0:30:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 温馨的家 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet home, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.87,0:30:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 温馨的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet ho…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.77,0:30:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要修整一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, sure, it needs a little work…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结构还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's got good bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.11,0:30:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大象墓园\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, this is an elephant graveyard…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.22,0:30:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会到大象墓园来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and who would ever come to an elephant graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.45,0:30:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 土狼在追孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire, the hyenas are after the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.83,0:30:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到食肉动物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see carnivores.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.63,0:30:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.17,0:30:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.47,0:30:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我现在跟你提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon? Would this be a bad time…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去过的那地方你会介意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring up that little place I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是家 温馨的家 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! This is home sweet home, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.91,0:30:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.51,0:30:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸气 蒸气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steam! Steam is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸气是… 水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steam is water. Gotta have water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦想之家就应该有水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for the dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸气的家 梦想之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steam home, dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.35,0:30:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸气 蒸气 蒸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steam, steam, steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:31:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am perfectly happy right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很偏僻 隐蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's remote, private…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有不速之客\N{\fnArial\fs30}no unexpected visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.50,0:31:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somethin' tells me this ain't…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔兰大河之舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}the traveling company of "Riverdance."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.58,0:31:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what you…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我怎么超越我的视线 看个屁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how am I supposed to look beyond what I see beyond that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.32,0:31:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.00,0:31:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方缺少水和遮蔽物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What this place lacks in water and shade…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是却有酷热和烈日\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes up for with searing heat and blinding sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 甜蜜家园 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet home, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.55,0:31:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃命吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we run for our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.98,0:31:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 快跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.57,0:32:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.30,0:32:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.07,0:32:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 残酷的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, cruel world!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.89,0:32:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不算太差嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.12,0:32:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满不会那么容易被打垮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't knock old Timon down that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 出招吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.36,0:32:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.37,0:32:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有没有可能 从地球边上掉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it possible to fall off the edge of the earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从技术上讲不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.11,0:32:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为地球是圆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The earth is round like a sphere, Timon…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.41,0:32:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有边\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it doesn't actually have an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以暂停一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I pause it for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.22,0:33:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.32,0:33:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.87,0:33:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界真是小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small world after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界真是小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small world after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.94,0:33:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个小小的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small, small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.38,0:33:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.75,0:33:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界真是小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small world after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了大盒的 我们可以分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I got the jumbo so we could share.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才在挖鼻孔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you just picking your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.00,0:33:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才在挖鼻孔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you just picking your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 是里面有点痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I had an itch on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.43,0:34:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.54,0:34:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.30,0:34:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没找到梦想之家呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still haven't found our dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.37,0:34:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.61,0:34:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拖着你乱跑已经够久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been dragging you down long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.58,0:34:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家 我建议你也回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going home, and I suggest you do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能回家我早就回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would if I could, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.95,0:34:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以回家 朋友 我不会阻拦你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you can, buddy. I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.89,0:34:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.73,0:34:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有家？怎么啦？你迷路啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't? What happened? Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.83,0:34:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你喜欢的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No place good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你孤零零的 活在这个空荡荡的世界上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you're all alone in this big empty world?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.65,0:35:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是孤独一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all alone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.92,0:35:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 你是我唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, you're the only friend I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.26,0:35:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.33,0:35:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 彭彭 而朋友要永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Pumbaa… and friends stick together to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.58,0:35:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 你哭啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:35:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是眼里进了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have something in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.02,0:35:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 擤一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.29,0:36:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.33,0:36:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真多谢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, l'm better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.96,0:36:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有找到 那个完美的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad we never found that perfect place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.50,0:36:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为何要听笨猴子的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd we ever listen to that stupid monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你太早放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe you're giving up too soon, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.94,0:36:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.94,0:36:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我跟你提到的那个地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that place I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提你那个地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.38,0:36:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我找到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a load of what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.35,0:37:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到「超越我的视线」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的梦想之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, this is our dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.09,0:37:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,生动的景色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dramatic views.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.13,0:37:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的吊床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your very own porch swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.89,0:37:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,水疗和三温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot tub and spa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.56,0:37:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,取之不尽的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well stocked cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们庆祝一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.63,0:37:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个猴子是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monkey was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.74,0:37:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了… 完美的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it… the perfect life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.97,0:37:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去搞点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just whip up a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.31,0:37:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他起的名字也最完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had the perfect name for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.75,0:37:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常漂亮的词语 还有独特的韵律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a wonderful phrase. It had this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.48,0:37:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[节拍]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laduda.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.29,0:37:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝这个… 热鲔鱼蛋饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this… hot tuna frittata.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.82,0:37:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.99,0:37:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,菠菜阿玛达\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spinach armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.32,0:37:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 我在想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, Pumbaa. I'm trying to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一勺干酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spoon of ricotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两个字 - 一份牛肉片\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two words. - A wormy piccata.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.80,0:37:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有六个音节 - 行家的克喇塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Si syllables. - Kahuna colada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十二个字母 - 蓝色的安奇拉塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twelve letters. - A blue enchilada.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.47,0:37:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,押韵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhymes with…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.50,0:37:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆子一盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legumes on a platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.34,0:37:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可辣呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ought to be hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.34,0:37:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我忘了 - 我要跳粘巴达\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I forget. - I got to lambada!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.34,0:38:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有心情跳舞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how can you dance at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.31,0:38:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快要想破头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.31,0:38:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.68,0:38:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.35,0:38:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔 就是无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata… it means "No worries."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Timon, I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.93,0:38:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来唱卡拉OK\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do a sing-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.47,0:38:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.40,0:38:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢卡拉OK 我来唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love karaoke. l'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.60,0:38:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.27,0:38:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么美妙的词语\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a wonderful phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.28,0:38:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.44,0:38:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一时流行的词语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no passin' craze.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.95,0:38:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the rest of your days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.42,0:38:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.36,0:38:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 那虫子跑哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, where's the grub?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.13,0:38:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是控制不住自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't help yourself, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.43,0:38:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.57,0:39:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回要控制一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, but this time, show a little self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.64,0:39:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the rest of your days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何烦恼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our problem free.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.02,0:39:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哲学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.83,0:39:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,马塔塔 哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matata Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.17,0:39:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hahuna Ma… 什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hahuna ma-what-a?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.74,0:39:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means "No worries."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.51,0:39:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.98,0:39:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 我就告诉那小子 去找哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I told the boy to find hakuna matata…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.12,0:39:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要超越自己的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must look beyond what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 那不是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, it's not a meta…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给丁满打比喻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used a metaphor on Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.03,0:40:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对什么都很认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes things literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.50,0:40:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在外边一定挨饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. He's starving out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.97,0:40:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯 丁满在外面找比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, Timon's out there chasing metaphors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.14,0:40:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把他找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.70,0:40:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.10,0:40:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有家庭的支持真好 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to have a supportive family, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我走啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.54,0:40:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 千里之行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, the journey of a thousand miles…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.35,0:40:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,始于足下\N{\fnArial\fs30}begins with the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.28,0:40:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我这就迈出第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Here's my first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.06,0:40:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来拿豪猪打保龄球 不是什么好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bowling for porcupines wasn't the best idea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.63,0:40:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这就跟拿屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Got to be right up there…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.36,0:40:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,钓鳄鱼一样糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}with bobbing for snapping turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.30,0:40:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会留下疤痕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's going to leave a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.97,0:40:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 看 秃鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, Timon, buzzards.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.14,0:40:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再来玩一轮 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, one more round?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.71,0:40:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure. There must be some part of me…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.41,0:40:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定还有没伤过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}we haven't injured yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.98,0:40:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please? Oh, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.08,0:40:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, Pumbaa, l'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.51,0:40:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩吧 我要回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go ahead. I'm calling it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.48,0:40:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是一个人玩没意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's no fun alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.26,0:41:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.83,0:41:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,多玩一轮不会改变我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more run won't change our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道那天命运是怎么把我们引到辛巴的面前的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows why fate led us to little Simba that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.70,0:41:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为我喜欢冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was just my love of adventure…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.60,0:41:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是我内在的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}or my innate courage…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.87,0:41:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大无畏的精神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}my valiant and fearless way of…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.48,0:41:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 是谁负责控制这些定格画面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, who's in charge of the freeze frames?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.28,0:41:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.55,0:41:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywho…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.38,0:41:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救辛巴不费吹灰之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}rescuing Simba was a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来才是可怕的部份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then came the really scary part…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.02,0:41:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}parenthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.46,0:41:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.96,0:41:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 狮子今晚已经熟睡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.66,0:41:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.50,0:41:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon. Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.64,0:41:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.31,0:41:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去 - 去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got to go. - Go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.04,0:41:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.24,0:41:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去… 尿尿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, go… bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.68,0:41:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说？好 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go? Why didn't you say so? Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.38,0:42:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该去时就得去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you got to go, you got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狮子 下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young lion, get down from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.99,0:42:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 从上面看起来你们像蚂蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Man, you guys look like ants down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.49,0:42:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数三下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.73,0:42:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.24,0:42:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.87,0:42:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.44,0:42:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.54,0:42:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. l'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this means you'll be up again…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.98,0:42:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过两个小时你又要去尿啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}about two hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.05,0:42:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 丛林布吉乐 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jungle boogie ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 丛林布吉乐，兴奋起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jungle boogie, get it on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.45,0:42:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点 辛巴 我来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Simba! I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.73,0:42:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.23,0:42:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 巨大的丛林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The mighty jungle… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.46,0:42:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样走下去会变老的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to get old walking across this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.47,0:42:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中，巨大的… ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the might… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.07,0:42:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.94,0:42:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么就是不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got against the concept…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.84,0:43:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡一觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a good night's sleep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, l…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.11,0:43:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了个噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.75,0:43:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 这样啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.18,0:43:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.25,0:43:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子做了个噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junior had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.26,0:43:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过来和我们一起来睡吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you sleep over here with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.99,0:43:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的彭彭 就是你的彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mi Pumbaa, su Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.43,0:43:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.83,0:43:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 狮子今晚已经熟睡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.00,0:43:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.17,0:43:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你今晚梦见臭虫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream of bedbugs tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.68,0:44:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.68,0:44:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不要害怕，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't fear, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.51,0:44:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿哈，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hey-a, oh, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.88,0:44:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不要害怕，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, don't fear, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.53,0:44:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不要害怕，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't fear, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.30,0:44:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿哈，我的小亲亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hey-a, oh, my little darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.18,0:44:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早上起床打哈欠的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch where you aim that morning breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.72,0:44:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我们躲开你张嘴的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should come with a warning label.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.52,0:44:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的会臭醒人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo, what a wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.12,0:44:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人有起床气喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like someone woke up on the wrong side of the warthog.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.66,0:45:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦 老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.86,0:45:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔 没用啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a little too much hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.83,0:45:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 哈库拉马塔塔 是我发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny boy, I invented hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那是我改良了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Well, I perfected it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.60,0:45:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you did, sure you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.87,0:45:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 谁保持吃虫子后 打饱嗝最长的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, who holds the record for the world's longest bug belch?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.54,0:45:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该是辛巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.38,0:45:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.98,0:45:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是吃鼻涕虫的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the champion at slug swallowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.38,0:45:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是辛巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嚼蟋蟀呢 - 辛巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cricket crunching? - Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.22,0:45:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吞虫虫呢 - 辛巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grub gulping? - Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.29,0:45:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃蛆呢 - 还是辛巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggot munching? - Still Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.62,0:45:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃蜗牛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snail slurping?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.79,0:45:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人是冠军 我们还没比过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody. We never had a snail eating contest before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.07,0:45:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是什么好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this is such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.26,0:46:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说过这不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you this wasn't such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.65,0:47:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比赛证明了青出于蓝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus did the pupil surpass the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.42,0:47:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又跟那猴子一起混啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been hanging around with the monkey again, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.03,0:47:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的辛巴长大啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Simba is growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.61,0:47:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我以前 抱过的那个小家伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls this the little boy I carried?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.91,0:47:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候他长得这么高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did he grow to be so tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.15,0:47:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好像还是昨天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.65,0:47:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是小小的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he was small?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.96,0:47:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出 日落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise, sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.53,0:47:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出 日落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise, sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.70,0:47:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光匆匆飞逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swiftly fly the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.50,0:48:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光匆匆飞逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swiftly fly the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.41,0:48:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个季节接着一个季节\N{\fnArial\fs30}One season following another.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.18,0:48:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laden with happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和泪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.09,0:48:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是它们叫粪金龟的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you see, that's why they call it a dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.13,0:48:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.86,0:48:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet still so tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.43,0:48:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, and they're my favorite, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.54,0:48:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟医生讲的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.88,0:48:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所事事一天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. After a long day of doing nothing…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.88,0:48:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一下真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's good to kick back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.15,0:48:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个朋友一起无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three pals and no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.55,0:48:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能要求什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more could you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.26,0:49:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.13,0:49:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think l'll turn in for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.31,0:49:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.95,0:49:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们折磨死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.26,0:49:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 轮到你说晚安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, it's your turn to say good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.76,0:49:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.93,0:49:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝今晚梦见臭虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream of bedbugs tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.86,0:49:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to admit…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那里过得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had a pretty good thing going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.93,0:50:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来可以一直过下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've gone on like that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们忽略了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for one teeny weeny little thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.20,0:50:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很小很小的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}we forgot to count on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.40,0:50:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.24,0:50:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么… - 你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you… - How did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个灾难 彭彭… 我告诉你 这是个灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a disaster, Pumbaa… a disaster, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.48,0:50:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个灾难 彭彭… 我告诉你 这是个灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a disaster, Pumbaa… a disaster, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.08,0:50:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他们好像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean because they've finally found each other…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.52,0:50:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找真爱多年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}like two soul mates joined across the years…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.19,0:50:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于再度重逢的情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the bonds of true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.92,0:50:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天真无邪的小彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet, innocent little Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.96,0:50:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会毁了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to put a stake right through the heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.12,0:50:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.56,0:50:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们应该要采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess we ought to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.10,0:50:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know just what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.53,0:50:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 今晚无论如何 都不能让他们感觉到爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, we can't let them feel the love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.42,0:51:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚能感受到这份爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel the love tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.88,0:51:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚能感受到这份爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel the love tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.89,0:51:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.47,0:51:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你能感受到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel the love…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.03,0:52:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你能感受到这份爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel the love tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.80,0:52:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,安详静谧的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The peace the evening brings?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.17,0:52:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招真灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that worked like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.91,0:52:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.21,0:52:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听不懂这是一种讽刺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarcasm is a foreign language to you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.41,0:52:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.45,0:52:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能否感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel the love…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在抛媚眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's making those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.32,0:52:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对她笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smiling that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.12,0:52:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在笑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're laughing…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.93,0:52:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拥抱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hugging…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.09,0:52:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.03,0:53:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他今晚坠入爱河\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he falls in love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.37,0:53:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一切就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be assumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.35,0:53:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我们的自由日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}His carefree days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.91,0:53:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With us are history.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.32,0:53:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单说 我们的朋友就报销了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln short, our pal is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,算啦 哥儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.63,0:53:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们竭尽了全力 但是还是失去了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gave it our best shot, but he's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.63,0:54:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.50,0:54:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从不放弃 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never give up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.27,0:54:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至不知道我经厉过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know what l've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.27,0:54:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你告诉我 我就知道了 - 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would if you'd ust tell me. - Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.37,0:54:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.58,0:54:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 你知道这意味着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.21,0:54:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没办法表达感情 而她对他还有疑虑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't express his feelings and she has commitment issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了 把他们拆散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won. We split them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.22,0:54:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是件好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他受到的打击不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to be taking it kind of hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.56,0:54:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. Look, l…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.73,0:54:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可对我们来说是好事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the best thing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.53,0:54:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 对他 我们走吧 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean for him. Let's go, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.40,0:54:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得暴风雨要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this storm's coming to a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.21,0:54:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔安全啦 哥儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata is safe at last, pal…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.58,0:54:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不论什么事 都无法带走我们的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}because nothing's going to take our boy away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.95,0:54:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了？你说什么 他走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone? What do you mean, he's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.75,0:54:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那只狒狒说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like the baboon said.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.99,0:55:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王已经回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.83,0:55:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我再说一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to go over it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.83,0:55:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please, but be a dear…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接跳到辛巴那段…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just skip to the part about Simba…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.33,0:55:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是嫌你童年不有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that your childhood wasn't fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.17,0:55:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着 辛巴才是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, look, Simba's the rightful king…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.64,0:55:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他失踪以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after he disappeared…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.14,0:55:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤自封为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar proclaimed himself the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.78,0:55:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和土狼结成了联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and formed an alliance with the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.61,0:55:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的辛巴 那个卖国贼 背信忘义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Simba… the treachery, the villainy…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑鄙下流 真是丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sheer indescribable horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.45,0:55:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么要逗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah. Why is she toying with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.75,0:55:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个母老虎想吃掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crazy chick is going to eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.79,0:55:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴一定要回家 向他的叔叔挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba has to go home to challenge his uncle…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新夺回属于他的王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}and reclaim his rightful place as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.03,0:55:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴需要我们… 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba needs us… now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.97,0:55:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.61,0:55:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就不该离开我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he shouldn't have left us!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.44,0:55:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他要回去 做他的「陛下」\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf he wants to run off to be "His Highness"…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.40,0:56:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「越快走越好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't let the branches hit you on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.45,0:56:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把哈库拉马塔塔留给真正欣赏它的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave hakuna matata to someone who appreciates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.89,0:56:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 丁满 没有辛巴 就不哈库拉马塔塔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Timon, it's not really hakuna matata without Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.16,0:56:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么啦 不哈库拉马塔塔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gotten into you? Not hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.46,0:56:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是疯话 我告诉你 这是疯话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy talk… crazy talk, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.26,0:56:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一切都没有变…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's changed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.76,0:56:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴来以前 我们也一样哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had hakuna matata before Simba…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.97,0:56:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们依然哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've still got it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.07,0:56:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 我们该去帮助 我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go help our friend, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.40,0:56:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 你也是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et tu, Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.44,0:56:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算就这样离开 放弃这一切？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just going to walk away, give up on all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.64,0:56:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说什么朋友要永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to "friends stick together to the end"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.25,0:56:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正打算问你相同的问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.42,0:56:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所需要的一切都在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got everything I ever wanted right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还比较像样点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is more like it…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.72,0:57:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多的是空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}elbow room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.57,0:57:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy, oh, boy, oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.48,0:57:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.42,0:57:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么美妙的词语\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a wonderful phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.49,0:57:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.22,0:57:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一时流行的词语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no passing craze.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.00,0:57:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.53,0:58:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无忧无虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.10,0:58:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 不要 什么也别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. No, no. Don't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.51,0:58:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.21,0:58:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到哈库拉马塔塔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.54,0:58:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.75,0:58:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.18,0:58:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.08,0:58:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy, happy, deliriously happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.15,0:58:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了 幸福 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Happy, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.52,0:58:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的幸福 为什么看起来很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you're so happy, why do you look so miserable?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.16,0:58:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我痛苦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miserable, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.53,0:58:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I be miserable?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.80,0:58:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know. Maybe my two best pals…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.30,0:58:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两个最好的朋友抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the world deserted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.87,0:58:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去做英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. They've headed off on some heroic mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.11,0:58:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.18,0:58:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的哈库拉马塔塔也跟他们一起走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my hakuna matata went with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.55,0:58:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.26,0:58:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我很高兴我们聊开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. l'm glad we had this talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.16,0:59:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里的工作结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.30,0:59:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友要永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends stick together to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.72,0:59:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么那样跑啊 那样也算是跑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was with the running? lf you can call that running.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.39,1:00:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是为了让你能赶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was giving you time to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.59,1:00:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个大笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, you big lug.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.26,1:00:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来吧 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.73,1:00:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有场仗在等着打呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a fight to catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.73,1:00:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们冲过草原吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's whip some grass.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.57,1:00:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是传奇的所在 有壮烈的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the stuff of legends… an epic struggle…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.04,1:00:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是英雄诞生之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}the place where heroes are born.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.91,1:00:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 这可能 是我们最难忘的时刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, this could be our finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.21,1:00:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤野猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luau!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.91,1:00:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃美味多汁的猪肉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf you're hungry for a hunk of fat and uicy meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.55,1:00:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我朋友彭彭 因为他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat my buddy Pumbaa here because he…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直接开始追逐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just cut to the chase, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.79,1:00:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.66,1:00:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.01,1:00:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱彭彭早上的味道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the smell of Pumbaa in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.28,1:00:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪头 移开你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, move your tush, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.95,1:01:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？麦斯叔叔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma? Uncle Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 丁满 - 丁满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Timmy! - Timon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.85,1:01:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.62,1:01:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你啊 妈咪来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for you. Aw. Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来介绍一下 我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me introduce you to my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.69,1:01:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 我妈妈 麦斯叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, Ma, Uncle Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.60,1:01:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 麦斯叔叔 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma, Uncle Max, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.17,1:01:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 是辛巴 那一定是他的叔叔刀疤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's Simba, and that must be his uncle Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.94,1:01:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 他们谈和了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good, they're talking things out…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.90,1:01:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.44,1:01:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I have a feeling…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.01,1:01:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything's going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是话说回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.11,1:01:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼在上面保护刀疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hyenas are up there protecting Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.61,1:01:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.15,1:01:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.65,1:01:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能帮什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we help?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.62,1:01:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 麦斯叔叔 你们挖个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma, Uncle Max, you're going to dig a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.89,1:01:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to need…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.72,1:01:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}dare I say it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.33,1:01:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,地道 很多很多的地道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tunnels… lots and lots of tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.76,1:01:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Pumbaa, you and me…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.40,1:01:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要把土狼从辛巴那里引走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got to get those hyenas away from Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.23,1:01:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们引入陷阱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lure them into the trap?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.33,1:01:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都瞒不过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing gets past you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.78,1:01:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 来 我们上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Pumbaa, Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.11,1:02:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满和往常有点不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's different about Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.18,1:02:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也觉得？他穿了条裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think? He's wearing a dress!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.66,1:02:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 彭彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.79,1:02:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个只有有半个脑袋的土狼 叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call a hyena with half a brain?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.53,1:02:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 丁满 叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me, Timon. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.70,1:02:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,土蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gifted.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.14,1:02:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在说我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're talking about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.57,1:02:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们死前 绝对会后悔讲这些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your last meal, you're going to eat those words.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.68,1:02:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我想我们已经引起他们的注意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma, I think we got their attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.82,1:02:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 继续拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. Keep stalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.49,1:02:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.49,1:02:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.83,1:03:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Ma?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.37,1:03:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要点时间 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need more time, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.97,1:03:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freestyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.18,1:03:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来 再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Encore, encore.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.28,1:03:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是说「开胃菜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You mean entree, entree.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.75,1:03:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 直接把他们吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you right. Let's just eat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls it ready yet, Ma?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.59,1:03:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 继续拖延\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. Keep stalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.00,1:03:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.60,1:03:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.33,1:03:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,非洲大草原肉食动物之土狼 桑琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shenzi Marie Predatora Veldetta Jacquelina Hyena…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.04,1:03:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是否有荣幸娶你 做我的新娘？\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you do me the honor of becoming my bride?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.11,1:03:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.58,1:03:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑琪 拜托 我知道你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shenzi Marie, please. I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.35,1:03:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差异太大 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're too different. It'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.39,1:03:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想孩子会长成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will the children look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.52,1:03:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会打破很多 自然法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}That violates so many laws of nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.69,1:04:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 像我们这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. The problems of a couple of wacky kids…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.60,1:04:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,配对生下来的不正常孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like us don't amount to a hill of termites…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.70,1:04:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个疯狂的世界里 根本不是什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this nutty circle of life thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.53,1:04:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我问你 现在不结几时结？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I ask you… if not now, when?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.50,1:04:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果不要我 要谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf not me, who?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.37,1:04:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.31,1:04:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做你的伴郎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I be your best man?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.38,1:04:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 我们跳过婚礼 直接吃喜酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we skip the wedding and go straight to the buffet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.65,1:04:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.65,1:04:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, if you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.88,1:04:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 麦斯 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Max, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.42,1:04:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼进洞啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyenas in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮我 我弄不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help. It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.94,1:04:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it works for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.84,1:04:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.35,1:04:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.62,1:05:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.06,1:05:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃了他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.92,1:05:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看刀疤完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say Scar is down and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.99,1:05:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.65,1:05:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满在哪里 我的宝贝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Timon? Where's my baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受伤了 啊 不 他死了 或者更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt! Oh, no! He's dead! Or worse!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.06,1:05:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find him. We've got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.43,1:05:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. lt is not OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.97,1:05:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you tell me it's OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.10,1:05:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.68,1:05:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.35,1:06:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你漏了一处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed a spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.43,1:06:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.56,1:06:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,憋死啦 不能呼吸啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choking. Not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.29,1:06:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你们我是无法成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't have done it without you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:07:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的好小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.57,1:07:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓绝对不哭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised myself I wasn't going to cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.70,1:07:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 你真的长大了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've really come a long way, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.94,1:07:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到你要找的地方了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.04,1:07:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一个梦寐以求的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a place that was beyond my wildest dreams…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.51,1:07:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那里还不算是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it still wasn't home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.71,1:07:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.59,1:07:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到我们的新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to our new home…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.66,1:07:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有会吃我们的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}a predator-free environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.39,1:08:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 我真的要称赞你 这里什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hand it to you, Timon. This place has everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.90,1:08:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们团聚了 这才算家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that we're all here, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crane…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.91,1:08:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开翅膀 然后优雅的转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}spreads its wings, turns with dainty hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.49,1:08:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.82,1:08:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不用挖地洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're never gonna dig another tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.16,1:08:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖个地道 挖呀挖 挖个地道 挖呀挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digga tunnah, dig, digga tunnah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.46,1:08:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼啊 来不了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevermore the hyena come.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.60,1:08:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼啊 来不了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevermore the hyena come.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.83,1:08:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌颂伟大的丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing the praises of brave Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.27,1:08:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最勇敢的狐獴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bravest meerkat we've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.60,1:08:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没想到 他会帮助辛巴获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never dreamed he'd help Simba shine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.07,1:08:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明和猪交朋友是很酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proved it's cool to hang out with swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.61,1:08:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外的救星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accidentally saved the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.01,1:08:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,照计行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planned it so it would look that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.11,1:08:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们从沙土中解放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought us out of the dirt and sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.51,1:08:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的家人带到了幸福之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Led his family to the promised land.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.82,1:08:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌颂伟大的丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing the praises of brave Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.48,1:09:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,最勇敢的狐獴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravest meerkat we've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.56,1:09:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's it…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.20,1:09:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大结局 幸福的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}the big wrap-up, the happy ending…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.87,1:09:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,风光的收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}the grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.17,1:09:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over already?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.30,1:09:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Pumbaa, that's the thing about endings.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.21,1:09:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后… 就是结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.11,1:09:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看一次好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we watch it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.54,1:09:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 我们才刚看过 明天再看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, we ust saw it. Maybe tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.28,1:09:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.82,1:09:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有告诉我们 你们要看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me you were watching the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.38,1:09:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to watch, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.95,1:09:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我们刚看完 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma, we just finished. Show's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.66,1:09:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要倒一下带子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're just going to have to rewind it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.32,1:09:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.12,1:09:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯叔叔 我们要看那部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Max, we're going to watch the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.73,1:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.06,1:09:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了很多爆米花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I brought extra butter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.86,1:09:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还要再看一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys are watching the movie?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.27,1:09:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是值得看的故事 就值得多看几遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any story worth telling is worth telling twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么… - 啊 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the… - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.14,1:09:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.34,1:09:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.34,1:09:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 闪一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.51,1:09:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.18,1:09:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面的 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, down in front!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.58,1:09:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gawrsh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.95,1:10:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aloha!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.92,1:10:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.43,1:10:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 朋友 你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, buddy, you win.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.93,1:10:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.57,1:10:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库拉马塔塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Matata.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.30,1:10:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.37,1:10:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.14,1:10:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不习惯太多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't do so well in crowds.
